<title>HUNGARY: CESI index ends shade higher at new high.</title>
<headline>CESI index ends shade higher at new high.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index firmed 0.01 percent or 0.25 points to finish at 1,726.32 points, a new record high, on Thursday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
